<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>subbit-demo-tapes</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">&#128252; subbit-demo-tapes</div>
      <nav><a href="https://github.com/kompact-io/subbit-xyz">github</a></nav>
    </header>

    <h3>
      Intro
    </h3>

    <p>
      These demos focus on Subbit.xyz's L2 in application. 
    </p>
    
    <p>
      A demo is driven by the `typist`. 
      They orchestrate the various services.
      A service may belong to one or other party of a channel.
    </p>
    
    <p>
      The L1 component is mocked here. 
      This allows the demo to be reproducible.
    </p>
    <hr>

{{#videos}}
    <section class="tape">
      <h2>{{title}}</h2>
      <video controls preload="metadata" muted playsinline>
        <source src="videos/{{file}}" type="{{mime}}">
      </video>
      <p class="meta">tapes/{{stem}}.tape &middot; built in CI</p>
    </section>
{{/videos}}
{{^videos}}
    <p>No tapes have been rendered yet.</p>
{{/videos}}

    <hr>
    <footer>Terminal demos, recorded as code with <a href="https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs">vhs</a>, built reproducibly with Nix, via github actions </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
